      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could the body say what goes wrong without the patch, such as the `ublk_ch_mmap()` case? \"Keep P3S page-size selection and native ublk geometry unchanged\" only says what doesn\u0027t change.\n\nAlso, could the subject say \"4KB processes\" rather than \"PPPS host APIs\"? PPPS is the old abbreviation for P3S, and \"4KB processes\" would match aosp/4368076 and aosp/4368079.",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "e9bdee5e70b33769a30f141e920290997d1aa429",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "96ccf026_288784e0",
        "filename": "drivers/block/ublk_drv.c",
        "patchSetId": 10
      },
      "lineNbr": 888,
